# AGENTS.md — todo-cli

## Machine-checkable spec block

- **entrypoint:** `todo/__main__.py`
- **subcommands:** add, list, done, remove (one file each under `todo/cmds/`)
- **storage contract:** `todo/storage.py::save(items) -> None` — atomic;
  tests pin this signature in `tests/test_storage.py`.
- **invariant:** no subcommand may call `print()` outside
  `todo/cmds/_io.py` — enforced by `scripts/check_io_boundary.py`.
- **agent rule:** before editing any file listed above, read
  `tests/test_<name>.py` if it exists.
